        "original_id": "0f91020c-6983-5f1c-83b2-95ff7c53a5b8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Roads: Ohio State Route 78\n- Publications: Car and Driver, Popular Photography\n- Places: Nelsonville, Clarington, Orbiston, Buchtel, Ohio\n- People: Irv Teibel\n- Companies: Ziff Davis\n\nFacts:\n- Ohio State Route 78 is a state highway in Ohio that runs 105 miles (169 km) from Nelsonville to Clarington.\n- Car and Driver has called Ohio State Route 78 one of the most scenic highways in the United States.\n- Orbiston, Ohio, is located along Ohio State Route 78, 1.8 miles north-northeast of Buchtel.\n- Car and Driver has a total circulation of 1.23 million.\n- Irv Teibel worked as an editor for Ziff Davis and photographed for Popular Photography and Car and Driver.",
